--- !u!114 &900100010
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 900100002}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9f91b893a8fc326478afb66ca0f24527, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  infoText:
  - Earth is the third planet from the Sun and the only known planet to support life.
    About 71% of its surface is covered by water, with the rest made up of continents
    and islands.
  - It has a protective atmosphere composed mainly of nitrogen and oxygen, which
    helps regulate temperature and shield life from harmful radiation.
  - Earth rotates on its axis once every 24 hours, causing day and night, and orbits
    the Sun once every 365 days, creating the seasons.
  - "Mars is the fourth planet from the Sun and is often called the \u201CRed Planet\u201D
    because of its reddish appearance, caused by iron oxide (rust) on its surface."
  - It has a thin atmosphere made mostly of carbon dioxide and is much colder than
    Earth. Mars has the largest volcano in the solar system, Olympus Mons, and deep
    valleys like Valles Marineris.
  - Scientists study Mars closely because it may have once had liquid water and could
    have supported microbial life in the past.
  infoAudio:
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6d335dfd60d4e494b98f076fee4d7c43, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 646342ae5302b2d4b942a4542f00d2db, type: 3}
